From b59d607cac897dde19efc826b872988b873456b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:36:22 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: attendant and party manager menus

The attendant asks Solo or Multiplayer, and for Solo which tournament (the
Monster Gauntlet so far). The man at the counter's right becomes a party
manager: characters, Djinn, Psynergy and the Xian item shops. A prompt window
across the top and the choices across the bottom, drawn by ArenaMenu_Choose.
The training screens blank their window before each redraw. A win now reports
the coins won in a window instead of opening the training menu.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
